---
// Short punchy band — takes the old ConsultBanner's visual slot. Dark, not amber,
// so the amber "Start" CTA later stays the single loud call to action.
---
<section class="bg-surface border-y border-white/7">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-14 md:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl">
      <p class="font-display font-extrabold uppercase text-primary leading-tight" style="font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 40px);">
        Most shops run on gut feel, paper, and <span class="text-accent">tribal knowledge</span>.
      </p>
      <p class="text-muted text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-5 max-w-2xl">
        The bottleneck you <em class="not-italic text-primary">think</em> you have usually isn't the
        real one — and without data, every automation dollar is a guess.
        <span class="text-primary">BASELINE ends the guessing.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
